  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong>  </span>has released the notification for the post of 72nd&nbsp;Combined Competitive Examination Preliminary Examination 2026. This recruitment has been issued for 1186 posts. Candidates can also check all the details on the official &nbsp;website. The online application process for BPSC 72nd Recruitment 2026 has started on 07 May 2026, and candidates can apply till 31 May 2026. Candidates must check the complete details of BPSC 72nd Recruitment 2026 given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Bihar Public Service Commission (BPSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">BPSC 72nd CCE Pre Recruitment 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date :<strong> 07 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>31 May 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>31 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>Notify Later</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: 